<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Your Order {{order.reference}} was delivered</title></head>
<body style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.5;">
  <p>Hello {{customer.givenName}},</p>
  <p>Your Order <strong>{{order.reference}}</strong> was delivered on {{deliveredOn}}:</p>
  <ul>
    {{#lines}}
    <li>{{quantity}} × {{name}}</li>
    {{/lines}}
  </ul>
  <p>If you weren't home, look for a note from the Carrier. Enjoy!</p>
  <p>Ecomm</p>
</body>
</html>
